{"id": 8258555347142, "title": "Momcozy Hot and Cold Breast Pads with 2 Soft Covers", "body_html": "<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Cold Therapy for Cooling Relief:</strong> Simply freeze the Momcozy breast therapy packs at -18℃/-0.4℉ for at least 4 hours. Use them cold after nursing, pumping, or a long day of breastfeeding to enjoy a refreshing, cooling sensation that helps you relax and feel more at ease. Ideal for breastfeeding moms, exclusive pumpers, and those using a wearable breast pump—perfect for soothing after extended nursing sessions or night feedings.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Warm Comfort Anytime: </strong>Gently heat the Momcozy therapy packs in boiling water (over 80℃/176℉) for 2 minutes or in the microwave for 70 seconds at 350W. Enjoy the soothing warmth before breastfeeding or pumping to help you feel more relaxed and comfortable. A cozy companion for early-morning routines, work pumping sessions, or anytime you want a warm, comforting touch.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Larger Design for Full Breast Coverage:</strong> Featuring an extra-large size and gel-filled design, these breastfeeding heat and ice packs provide 360° coverage, fitting comfortably inside nursing bras or around breast pumps. Convenient for working moms, postpartum recovery, and on-the-go nursing mothers</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Essential for Breastfeeding &amp; Postpartum Recovery: </strong>Designed for new moms, expecting mothers, and postpartum care, these hot and cold breast therapy packs make a perfect baby shower gift, hospital bag essential, and breastfeeding support tool.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"a-list-item\"><strong>Safe to Use: </strong>The gel is non-toxic and BPA/ BPS free, making it a reliable choice. The soft and flexible material is also gentle on your skin.</span></p>", "vendor": "momcozy", "product_type": "Breast pads", "created_at": "2024-07-04T06:29:15-04:00", "handle": "momcozy-hot-and-cold-breast-pads-with-2-soft-covers", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:56-04:00", "published_at": "2026-05-21T05:04:55-04:00", "template_suffix": "bp-bf008", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "乳房护理, 吸奶器, 吸奶器小品, 小品主链", "variants": [{"id": 43928794955974, "product_id": 8258555347142, "title": "Default Title", "price": "14.99", "sku": "BF008-NA00NB-B", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "14.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Default Title", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2024-07-04T06:29:15-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:54:56-04:00", "taxable": false, "barcode": "196415245225", "grams": 400, "image_id": null, "weight": 0.3997, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}], "options": [{"id": 10338585575622, "product_id": 8258555347142, "name": "Title", "position": 1, "values": ["Default Title"]}], "images": [{"id": 42791645872326, "product_id": 8258555347142, "position": 1, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:30:08-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:30:11-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 1200, "height": 1498, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0559/2321/2486/files/4_afd823fd-d737-4bec-89f9-67482c886e8c.jpg?v=1779352211", "variant_ids": []}, {"id": 37236182515910, "product_id": 8258555347142, "position": 2, "created_at": "2024-07-04T06:29:20-04:00", "updated_at": "2024-07-04T23:33:11-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 1500, "height": 1500, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0559/2321/2486/files/71RsrKSuMUL._SL1500.jpg?v=1720150391", "variant_ids": []}, {"id": 42791645937862, "product_id": 8258555347142, "position": 3, "created_at": "2026-05-21T04:30:08-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-05-21T04:30:11-04:00", "alt": null, "width": 1500, "height": 1500, "src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0559/2321/2486/files/614rVre93QL._SL1